   "id": "1",
   "label": "冒瀆する・神を汚す",
   "label_en": "to blaspheme / defile God",
   "label_es": "blasfemar / profanar a Dios",
   "def": "神・聖霊・神の名・神の言葉・教えなど、聖なるものを汚す言葉を発する。",
   "def_en": "To utter words that defile what is holy: God, the Holy Spirit, God's name, God's word, teaching."
